{"timestamp":"2026-05-26T08:30:19.893Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","call_id":"call_mjWtK9LNiuQ8id9G0e6Ik1U7","output":"Chunk ID: 6dc90a\nWall time: 0.0000 seconds\nProcess exited with code 0\nOriginal token count: 336\nOutput:\n\tcamera.make_current()\n\nfunc _create_character_frames() -> SpriteFrames:\n\tvar frames := SpriteFrames.new()\n\tfor anim in [\"idle_down\", \"idle_up\", \"idle_right\", \"idle_left\", \"walk_down\", \"walk_up\", \"walk_right\", \"walk_left\"]:\n\t\tframes.add_animation(anim)\n\t\tframes.set_animation_speed(anim, 8.0)\n\t\tframes.set_animation_loop(anim, true)\n\tframes.add_frame(\"idle_down\", _puny_frame(Vector2i(0, 0)))\n\tframes.add_frame(\"idle_left\", _puny_frame(Vector2i(0, 2)))\n\tframes.add_frame(\"idle_right\", _puny_frame(Vector2i(0, 5)))\n\tframes.add_frame(\"idle_up\", _puny_frame(Vector2i(0, 4)))\n\tfor col in range(0, 6):\n\t\tframes.add_frame(\"walk_down\", _puny_frame(Vector2i(col, 0)))\n\t\tframes.add_frame(\"walk_left\", _puny_frame(Vector2i(col, 2)))\n\t\tframes.add_frame(\"walk_right\", _puny_frame(Vector2i(col, 5)))\n\t\tframes.add_frame(\"walk_up\", _puny_frame(Vector2i(col, 4)))\n\treturn frames\n\nfunc _puny_frame(coord: Vector2i) -> AtlasTexture:\n\treturn _atlas_custom(CHARACTER_SHEET, Rect2(coord.x * 32, coord.y * 32, 32, 32))\n\nfunc _update_character_animation(direction: Vector2) -> void:\n\tif player_sprite == null:\n\t\treturn\n\tif direction == Vector2.ZERO:\n\t\tplayer_sprite.play(\"idle_%s\" % player_facing)\n\t\treturn\n\tif abs(direction.x) > abs(direction.y):\n\t\tplayer_facing = \"right\" if direction.x > 0 else \"left\"\n\telse:\n\t\tplayer_facing = \"down\" if direction.y > 0 else \"up\"\n"}}
